OL,11,G0232 Tech Life
OL,12,     FMillions of us play on consoles,
OL,13,     Flaptops and phones - it's big
OL,14,     Fbusiness. Grand Theft Auto 6 is
OL,15,     Fthe latest blockbuster release.
OL,16,     FBut is gaming having an impact on
OL,17,     Fthe environment?
